00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:09.976
WEEKS.
UKRAINIAN PRESIDENT, VOLODYMYR

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:16.182
ZELENSKYY, SAYS HE'S PROUD THAT
ALL 13 DRONES WERE SHUTDOWNS IN

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.051
WEDNESDAY'S ATTACKS, TWO
BUILDINGS AND HOUSE WERE

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:24.023
DAMAGED.
UKRAINE HAS LONG BEEN ASKING --

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:28.995
PATRIOT MISSILE DEFENSE SYSTEM.
NOW THE WHITE HOUSE TOWELS CNN

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.396
THAT IT'S FINALIZING PLANS TO
DO SO.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:34.267
THE KREMLIN SAYS, IF THAT
HAPPENS, THE SYSTEM WOULD BE A

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.171
LEGITIMATE TARGET FOR RUSSIA.
&gt;&gt; CNN'S NATIONAL --

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.274
HE IS ON THE GROUND IN KYIV,
AND HE HAS THE LATEST FROM THAT

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:43.476
UKRAINIAN --
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE WERE WOKEN UP TO THE

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:47.013
SOUND OF EXPLOSIONS IN THE
EARLY MORNING HOUR IN KYIV, A

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.581
SHORT DISTANCE FROM WHERE I'M
STANDING.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.017
SOME PEOPLE WERE UP ALREADY
GETTING READY FOR WORK, WHEN WE

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:54.954
HEARD THAT A VERY VERY
DISTINCTIVE SOUND OF THE DRONE

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:59.025
ENGINES FOLLOWED BY EXPLOSIONS.
ONE OF THE DRONES ACTUALLY

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.561
CAUSED A HUGE HOLE INSIDE OF A
BUILDING.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.163
THERE WAS DAMAGE, PEOPLE HAD
THEIR IMPORTANT WINDOWS

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.098
SHATTERED.
YET, REMARKABLY THE TRAIN

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.968
MILITARY SAYS THAT IN THIS
DRONE ATTACK, ON KYIV, THE

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:13.039
FIRST IN A NUMBER OF WEEKS,
HERE IN THE CENTRAL AREA, THERE

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:16.075
HAS BEEN NO SIGNIFICANT DAMAGE
TO THE POWER GRID ON TOP OF

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.477
WHAT THEY'RE ALREADY DEALING
WITH.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.246
THERE ARE ROLLING BLACKOUTS
CONTINUOUSLY, AFFECTING PEOPLE

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:23.216
WHO LIVE HERE IN, KEEP.
ALSO AFFECTING PEOPLE WHO LIVE

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.118
ALL OVER UKRAINE.
THE POWER GRID IS FAR FROM

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.986
STABLE.
IT'S GOING TO BE QUITE SOME

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:30.089
TIME, AS CREWS CONTINUE TO WORK
TO TRY TO REPAIR THESE

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.125
FACILITIES THAT ARE
CONTINUOUSLY DAMAGED BY THESE

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:36.029
RUSSIAN ATTACKS, WEAPONIZING,
WINTERTIME HARD DURING THE

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.330
POWER GRID.
--

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.434
THE START OF WINTER IS JUST
DAYS AWAY.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:45.137
EVEN THOUGH IN THIS INSTANCE,
THE UKRAINIANS DID SHOOT DOWN,

00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:48.441
THEY SAY, 13 DRONES FIRED FROM
RUSSIA.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.144
THESE ARE IRANIAN MADE DRONES
THAT EXPLODE UPON IMPACT.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:55.882
THERE WERE INCIDENTS, JUST IN
THAT LAST WEEK, OR SOME OF THE

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:58.017
JOHNSTON MAKE IT THROUGH.
FOR EXAMPLE, THE SOUTHERN

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.920
UKRAINIAN REGION IN ODESSA, ONE
AND A HALF MILLION PEOPLE WERE

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:04.958
PLUNGED INTO DARKNESS LAST
WEEKEND WHEN OUT OF 15 DRONES

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.227
THAT WERE LAUNCHED BY RUSSIA,
FIVE OF THEM DID HIT THEIR

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:09.229
TARGETS.
THEY WERE CERTAINLY WELCOME

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:12.198
NEWS HERE IN KYIV THAT THE
REPORTING BY CNN THAT THE

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:15.034
PATRIOT MISSILE DEFENSE SYSTEM
WILL BE ARRIVING AT SOME POINT

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:17.203
IN THIS COUNTRY.
BUT OF COURSE, THAT COMES WITH

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.173
ITS OWN SET OF CHALLENGES AND
RISK, INCLUDING THREATS FROM

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.041
THE RUSSIANS THAT THIS WILL
MAKE NATO, AND THE UNITED

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.344
STATES, COMPLICIT IN ESCALATING
THIS WAR.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:29.015
WILL RIPLEY, CNN, KYIV.
&gt;&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE IS

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:32.619
FINALIZING A PACKAGE TO SEND THE
PATRIOT MISSILE TO UKRAINE.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:35.888
AN OFFICIAL ANNOUNCEMENT COULD
KM THIS WEEK.

00:02:35.888 --> 00:02:40.493
IT NEEDS TO BE APPROVED BY ROY
AUSTIN.

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:44.230
SCOTT McCLAIN HAS THE LATEST ON
THIS FOR US.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:47.533
SCOTT, HOW WOULD THIS MAKE A
DIFFERENCE ON THE BATTLEFIELD

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:49.969
FOR UKRAINE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: CHRISTINE, THE

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:54.607
UKRAINIANS HAVE BEEN ASKING FOR
MONTHS FOR NATO ALLIES TO SEND

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:57.877
MORE ADVANCED AIR DEFENSE
SYSTEMS, ESPECIALLY GIVEN THE

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:00.880
ATTACKS ON ITS INFRASTRUCTURE AS
OF LATE.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.252
THE SYSTEMS IT HAS ALREADY,
THOSE SEEM TO DO JUST FINE.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:17.230
THERE WAS A BARRAGE OF DRONES
AIMED AT KYIV AND ACCORDING TO

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:26.973
ZE ZELENSKYY, IT HIT BUILDINGS
AROUND THE CITY AND HOMES.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.341
IT'S NOT CLEAR WHAT THE TARGET
WAS.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.977
PERHAPS WE HAVE A CLUE AS TO
WHAT THE MOTIVATION MAY HAVE

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.946
BEEN, AT LEAST ACCORDING TO
UKRAINIAN TELEVISION.

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:43.122
IT HAD ONE OF THE FRAGMENTS THAT
HAD AN INSCRIPTION ON IT

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:47.226
REFERRING TO A DRONE STRIKE
EARLIER.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:55.801
AS FOR THE PATRIOT MISSILE
SYSTEM THAT UKRAINE HAS BEEN

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:57.970
GIVEN SINCE THE OUTSET OF THE
WAR.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.774
THE DIFFERENCE IS THAT IT HAS
THE ABILITY TO SHOOT DOWN

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:09.082
INCOMING DRONES, ROCKETS,
AIR

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.116
AIRCRAFT.
THEY HAD A FURTHER DISTANCE

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:12.752
WHICH MEANS POTENTIALLY YOU
COULD STRIKE DOWN THE TARGETS

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.754
FARTHER AWAY FROM THE INTENDED
TARGETS.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:17.089
YOU WOULDN'T HAVE THE KIND OF
SITUATION WE HAVE THIS MORNING

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:20.093
IN KYIV POTENTIALLY WHERE YOU
HAVE FRAGMENTS OF THE MISSILES

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:25.698
OR DRONES OR WHAT HAVE YOU DOING
DAMAGE IN THE CITY.

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:29.268
THE DIFFICULTY IS IT TAKES A
LARGE CREW TO OPERATE AND DOZENS

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:32.238
OF PEOPLE AND THE TRAINING ON
THIS SYSTEM, IT TAKES MONTHS.

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:35.942
NOW THE U.S. HAS THIS CHALLENGE
OF TRYING TO TRAIN UP UKRAINIAN

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:39.612
TROOPS THAT WILL BE USING THIS
SYSTEM AT ITS AIRBASE IN

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.814
GERMANY.
AS I SAID, NORMALLY IT TAKES

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:43.850
MONTHS.
THEY'RE GOING TO TRY TO CONDENSE

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.519
THAT DOWN TO AS LITTLE TIME AS
POSSIBLE.

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:48.254
&gt;&gt; SCOTT McCLAIN, THANK YOU SO
MUCH FOR THAT.

